<title>USA: BB&amp;T Corp completes UCB acquisition.</title>
<headline>BB&amp;T Corp completes UCB acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WIBNSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BB&amp;T Corp, a bank holding company with $26.5 billion in assets, said Wednesday it has completed its acquisition of United Carolina Bancshares.</p>
<p>BB&amp;T said Whiteville, N.C.,-based United Carolina will continue to operate its branches under the UCB name until its systems convert to BB&amp;T in mid-September. UCB, with assets of $4.4 billion, operates 153 branches in the Carolinas.</p>
<p>BB&amp;T will have 485 banking offices in the Carolinas and Virgina when the UCB system conversion is completed, it said.</p>
</text>
